stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PROPOSED : propose (system)
    PROPOSED --> REVIEWED : review (analyst or above)
    PROPOSED --> REJECTED : reject + reason
    REVIEWED --> APPROVED : approve (pricing / category manager, admin)<br/>PolicyEngine must pass
    REVIEWED --> REJECTED : reject + reason
    REVIEWED --> REVIEWED : approval blocked by policy (audited)
    APPROVED --> APPROVED : dry-run execute (default)
    APPROVED --> ACTIONED : real execute<br/>needs WRITES_ENABLED + integration (none ships)
    ACTIONED --> MEASURED : record outcome
    PROPOSED --> EXPIRED : expires_at passed
    REVIEWED --> EXPIRED : expires_at passed
    APPROVED --> EXPIRED : expires_at passed
    REJECTED --> [*]
    MEASURED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
